  "instructions": [
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut milk, peanut butter, fish sauce, lime juice, and palm sugar until smooth.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes, or up to 2 hours in the refrigerator.",
    "Preheat the oil in a deep frying pan or a deep fryer to 180°C.",
    "Thread the chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Fry the chicken in batches until golden brown and crispy, about 5-7 minutes per batch.",
    "Drain the chicken on paper towels and serve hot with additional peanut sauce for dipping.",
    "If using tofu, pan-fry until golden brown and crispy, about 3-5 minutes per side.",
    "Serve the chicken and tofu with a side of steamed vegetables or rice.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro, mint, or basil leaves, if desired."
  ],
